NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000153 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000154 "Please visit the project's homepage at L<https://metacpan.org/release/Text-Table-TinyWide>."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000155 ""
